# ICOM IC-M710 VFO Controller — v1.0.7

## Version 1.0.7 — New Features

Version **1.0.7** introduces a new Communication page and additional controls on the Main page.

## 1. Communication / COM Port Page

A separate **Communication / COM Port** page has been added.

This page contains the communication configuration for the IC-M710.

### Communication Settings

* COM Port
* Baud Rate
* Controller ID
* Radio ID
* Connect / Disconnect

Communication settings are now separated from the Main operating page.

---

## 2. COM Port Monitor

A **COM Port Monitor** has been added to the Communication / COM Port page.

The monitor allows the user to observe communication between the controller and the IC-M710.

It can be used to check:

* COM port communication
* CI-V commands
* Radio responses
* Communication activity
* Communication problems

The COM Monitor is useful when testing or troubleshooting the radio connection.

---

## 3. Main Page — RIT Control

**RIT Control** has been added to the Main page.

The RIT control allows the receive frequency to be adjusted independently from the main VFO frequency.

This provides quick receive-frequency adjustment without changing the main operating frequency.

---

## 4. Main Page — RF Level

**RF Level** has been added to the Main page.

The controller reads the IC-M710 received signal level and displays the RF/signal level in real time.

The RF Level display provides a simple indication of the current received signal strength.

---

## 5. v1.0.7 Summary

### Communication Page

* Separate COM Port configuration
* COM Port Monitor
* Communication monitoring

### Main Page

* RIT Control
* RF Level display/control

---

